Depends: adduser, libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libssl3 | libssl3t64, libfontconfig1, libdrm2, libgbm1, libegl1, libgles2, libinput10, libudev1
Description: 3C Tool feeder for FluidNC mills
 Runs on the Raspberry Pi next to the mill: stores jobs uploaded from the
 3C Tool desktop, streams them to the FluidNC controller, journals every run
 for crash recovery and collects operator feedback for feed learning.
 .
 Includes the feeder daemon (3ctool-feederd, gRPC over TLS for paired
 desktops) and the touch screen UI (3ctool-feeder-ui), which starts full
 screen on the DRM console.
